SUMMARY:Shining Rock Wilderness and Sam's Knob Lollypop loop FITNESS HIKE
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nThe Hike will start at the Sam's K
 nob parking lot at the end of the Black Balsum Knob Road off the Parkway. 
 There are toilets at the parking lot whick hopefully will be open.\nWe wil
 l hike up Sam's Knob first for a warm up and then return to the parking lo
 t to get on the connector trail to the Art Loeb trail which will take us u
 p to Shining Rock. We will then return via the Investor Gap trail part of 
 the way and then retrace our steps across Tenant Mt. to get back to the pa
 rking lot.\nThe hike will be about 13 miles with 2300' elevation gain.\nTh
 is route is full of expansive views. It is also very open most of the way 
 and the weather is supposed to be sunny and in the mid 70's so bring lots 
 of water and sunscreen and maybe a raincoat just in case there is an after
 noon shower. Here is a link to the route.\nhttps://www.alltrails.com/explo
 re/custom-routes/custom-route-sams-knob-via-art-loeb-trail-loop-74c76d1\n\
 n**Pace:** We will hike at a brisk pace averaging approximately 3 mph adju
 sting for steepness of grade and rugged trail conditions. Please be comfor
 table with this distance\, elevation and pace.\n**Dogs\; F**riendly dogs o
 k.\n\n**Car Pool or Follow to the trailhead.** To Carpool\, meet at the We
 stgate Plaza parking lot near the dumpsters below Earthfare at 8:20 am. Pl
 ease post if you plan to meet us there otherwise we will see U at the trai
 lhead at 9:30 am.\n\n**Hike Levels:** Level (1) Up to 600 feet\; Level (2)
  600'- 900'\; Level (3) 900' - 1200'\; Level (4) 1200' - 1500'\; Level (5)
  1\,500' - 1\,800'\; Level (6) 1\,800' - 2\,100'\; Level (7) 2\,100' - 2\,
 400'\; Level (8) 2\,400' - 2700'\; Level (9) 2700' - 3000' Level (10) 3000
 ' - 4000'\; Ultimate Hikes are > 4\,000'.\n**Hike Cancellation:** IF YOU S
 IGN ON THIS HIKE AND CHANGE YOU MIND (EVEN IF ON THE WAITLIST) GO BACK TO 
 THE RSVP LINK AND CHANGE YOUR HIKE STATUS TO FREE UP YOUR RESERVED SPOT.\n
 **Release of Liability:**\nThe organizer of this trip is a volunteer and n
 ot a professional guide. The function of the organizer is only to organize
  this trip. If you sign up or participate in this event you acknowledge th
 at you freely and voluntarily agree to assume all risks of injuries\, illn
 esses\, and damages arising from\, as a result of\, and associated with th
 is event. In addition\, you acknowledge that you agree to the Meetup terms
 : [https://www.meetup.com/terms](https://www.meetup.com/terms)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/315442610
 /
